Untested: not applied in the Dockerfile. Would let wibo spawn child processes under QEMU user mode
(CLONE_PIDFD is rejected with EINVAL), removing the need for build_scr.py's separate lib /def step.
Against wibo 74517de90dc92855571c8fb76941b1051bc41d8e. Apply with: git apply wibo-qemu-spawn.patch

